  ("TWO ROOTS NEVER SHARE A PICTURE, EVEN WHEN THEY MEAN THE SAME THING, and twenty-one rows from the letters before 2 Corinthians broke that and were mended at once. Where the two words turned out to be one root, the word was filed under that root and kept its picture: darken under darkness, finally under loipos, quick under tachu, remembrance under mimnesko, to shine on under light. Where they were two roots, the newer word got a picture of its own: Abba is the father and speech; Satan is the horned face as a name, and wicked keeps the bare face; to make straight, straight and to direct (the euthus words) are the railway track, since the ruler is righteousness; far is the ruler and away, since the ruler as a manner is righteously; the rule (kanon) is the set square and the pin, a line laid down; a wave (kludon) is the wave turning; a wound (molops) is the fist and blood, since the bandage as a thing belongs to another root; a hole (ope) is the door and the hole, a gap in a rock or wall, since the bare hole is the Hebrew cave; to deceive and deception (apate) add the lying face to the trap, since the bare trap is the Hebrew snare; to pour forth (bruo) adds the droplet to the fountain; comfort (paregoria) is the hug and speech, a soothing word; to train (gumnazo) is lifting again and again, since lifting is to strengthen and the strong arm is might. Turned down: a running man for to train, since running is the race.");
  ("2 CORINTHIANS IS DRAWN THE SAME WAY, and its Greek words that mean what a Hebrew word means are filed under their own Greek roots and copy the Hebrew picture, which is allowed because the two testaments are separate tables: the tablet (plax), last year, to rob, to scatter, the stronghold, the window and the left hand. Where the Greek root already drawn in the New Testament wore that picture, the Greek word got its own: a thorn (skolops, a stake) is thorns and the pin, since bare thorns are akantha; a basket (sargane, a plaited rope basket) is the basket and the knot, since the bare basket is kophinos; mourning (odurmos, wailing) is loud crying and the loudspeaker, since loud crying as a thing is penthos. Other new pictures, with what was turned down: to shine (lampo) is the flashlight, since sparkles as doing is to make holy; whenever (henika) is the clock repeating, a root of its own, kept apart from when, which is the clock looking back; to enlarge (platuno) is both ways and the road, a widening, since both ways as doing is to make room (choreo); the veil is the umbrella over the face, since the bride's veil is a virgin; to be at home and away from home are in and out of the crowd, one's own people; illumination is light handed out; to find fault is the pouting face speaking; to plan is the light bulb and writing hand; need is the help button and the open hand; to beat with rods is the white cane and the fist; wonder is the astonished face and eyes; pressure is upon and the clamp; to handle deceitfully is the actor's masks and the hand; to betroth is the ring and the handshake. Purity (hagnotes) is filed with hagneia and the perfecting (katartisis) with katartismos, the same words, and keep their pictures. A Corinthian, a Macedonian, an Israelite and a man of Damascus are the place's or the nation's picture with a person, the way a Galatian is. Belial (Beliar) is a Hebrew word, worthlessness, used by Paul as a name (2 Corinthians 6:15), so it copies the Hebrew picture and adds the name tag. Aretas, the king whose governor guarded Damascus (2 Corinthians 11:32), is the king and the desert, a king of the Arabs; his name's meaning is not known. Paradise is the garden in the sky, where Paul was caught up (2 Corinthians 12:4), since the bare garden is the Hebrew garden of Eden and the garden house is a neighbour.");
  ("HEBREWS IS DRAWN THE SAME WAY. Its Greek words that mean what a Hebrew word means copy the Hebrew picture under their own Greek roots: the male goat (tragos) is the goat with the horn, the bull (tauros) is the bull, sand (ammos) is the sea's brown edge, ashes (spodos) are ashes and the burnt offering (holokautoma) is the burnt offering. The heifer (damalis) is the cow and the female sign, since the bare bull is the Hebrew heifer's word. Manna is bread from the sky. Where a picture was already worn by another Greek root, the Hebrews word got its own: brief (brachus) is the pinching hand and the hourglass, since the bare pinching hand is small (mikros); to spring up (phuo) is the seed going up, since the sprout doing is life; to yield (hupeiko) is bowing down, since kneeling down is to submit; a craftsman (technites) is the artist, since the tools' doer is a workman; the whirlwind (thuella) is the cyclone, since the tornado is lailaps; hyssop is the herb and the droplet, a sprinkler, since the bare herb is grass; seizure (harpage) is the snatching hand and the money bag, since snatching as a thing is harpagmos; burning (kausis) is the candle and the fire; the encumbrance (onkos) is many backpacks, since the bare package is a matter (pragma); the anchor is the anchor and the ship, since the bare anchor is already taken; reverence (eulabeia) adds fear to taking hold well; an attendant (therapon) is the bandage and the giving hands, since the bandage's doer is a physician and the bandage with a person is a leper; doing good (eupoiia) is well and the hammer, since the thumbs-up hammer is doing good of another root. To translate and hard to explain are filed with methermeneuo, the same word, and keep its picture; the word hard (dus) is the lock, as in hard to understand. The foot is a step (basis): to cross over, the outcome and permanent are through, out of and not past the foot. The thistle (tribolos) is three arrows, its own name; to saw in two is the saw; the scourge is the thread striking; the mercy seat is atonement and the seat; the olive branch held out is supplication; the jar (stamnos) is the amphora; a corpse (kolon) is the skull and the leg; marrow is in the bone; the stars of Abraham's promise (astron) are the plain star as a thing. Turned down: the bare drum for to torture, since torture by the drum (tumpanizo) is the drum beaten with a fist.");
  ("THE LAST WORDS OF HEBREWS. Its names from the Hebrew Bible, Aaron, Melchizedek, Salem, Abel, Esau, Jericho, Gideon, Barak and Samson, copy the Hebrew pictures and are filed under the Hebrew roots. Salem shares the picture of Jerusalem under the root Jerusalem is already filed under here, because the psalm names them as one place (Psalm 76:2); a picture of its own was turned down as making two cities of one. Levitical is Levi's handshake name as a describing word, since the bare handshake describing is already common, and Egyptian is the narrow place with a person, as in the Hebrew. Red is the red circle as a describing word; blood was turned down because blood already wears its own picture. Italy is probably the land of calves, drawn as the map and the calf, and the probably is said in the overlay; a Roman eagle was turned down as an emblem and not the name. And yet (kaitoi) is and with the exclamation, the and that turns against what was said.");
  ("ROMANS IS DRAWN THE SAME WAY, and its Greek words that mean what a Hebrew word means copy the Hebrew picture under their own Greek roots: beautiful feet (horaios) wear the face and sparkle of beautiful, the fatness of the olive (piotes) the bacon of fat, clay (pelos) the brown square and water, the womb (metra) the hugging face and baby, the potter (kerameus) the artist, and to abhor (bdelusso) the vomiting of an abomination. Where a new picture was needed, with what was turned down: grafted in is in, the branch and doing, and broken off is out, the branch and the crash, since breaking bread was turned down for branches; tribute is the coin and the cart it is carried in, since the coin and the crown already mean gold; the neck is the giraffe, the plainest neck there is; meat is the meat on the bone, since bare meat is already flesh; vegetables are the herb and the fork and knife; the throat is the mouth and the hole, an open grave (Romans 3:13); the asp is the snake with the tooth; coals are fire and the rock; to boil is bubbles and fire; a trap is the net and the deer, game caught, since the mouse trap is the snare; stupor is the dizzy and sleeping face; the back is the body and the back arrow; tenderly devoted is the friend's heart with the houses of a family, since the friend's heart with the child is already love of children; the patroness Phoebe (Romans 16:2) is the one who stands before with the woman's sign; groaning, travail, suffering, comfort, glory, help, rest, striving, growing and agreeing together each take the pin of together on the picture they already wear alone. Hardness, mind-set, forbearance, futility, deceit, the grave, merciless, worthless and to think too highly each took one more sign because the shorter picture was already another root's.");
  ("1 CORINTHIANS IS DRAWN THE SAME WAY. Its Greek words that mean what a Hebrew word means copy the Hebrew picture: bronze, the harp, to shave with the razor, to play with the laughing face, since the golden calf verse it quotes says the Hebrew word for laughing (1 Corinthians 10:7, Exodus 32:6), to catch with the net of the Hebrew word Job says there (1 Corinthians 3:19, Job 5:13), and to clang or wail with the crying face and loudspeaker of wailing. Where a new picture was needed, with what was turned down: earthly is the man of dust (1 Corinthians 15:47), since dust as a describing word is already murky; victory is the trophy and the fist, since the trophy as a thing is already the prize; the sting is the scorpion's (Revelation 9:10); to shear is the scissors and the hair, and long hair is more hair; a noose is the knot and the loop; the race is the runner and the measuring ruler, since the stadium is not in the picture set; to box is the glove and a person; birds are the bird and the wing; to boast is the peacock; refuse is what is swept off all round, and scum is what is washed off all round; to play the harp is the harp and the hand, since harp and doing is already the psalm; a cymbal is the bronze drum; guidance is the ship's wheel, the word being the helmsman's; beasts are the ox and all, since the bare ox is already the word for an ox; soft is the yarn of soft wool; the meat market is the meat and the house; insane is the zany face; to be at leisure for is the person sitting in the lotus position, since the school was turned down as reading as a building; a riddle is speech and the question; the twinkling of an eye is the wink; to be struck down is down and the skull, since down and the bed is already to lie down; to strike under the eye is the glove and the eye; past the prime is over and the top; untimely birth is the baby out too fast; to plow is the ox on the earth, since there is no plough and the tractor was turned down as of this age; to defile is the black spot on the shirt (Revelation 3:4), since the bare spot as doing is already to stain; thinking is the brain and the heart, since the brain as a thing is already foolishness; to ring is the bell and the loudspeaker, since the bell as doing is already a divine warning; marana tha is our Lord, come, the crown, the footprints and the exclamation; ten thousand and five hundred are the numbers as the other numbers are. Concession, using up, self-control and without honor each took one more sign because the shorter picture was already another root's. Its names: Sosthenes is of safe strength, rescue and lifting; Chloe is green, the leaf with the woman's sign; Crispus is curly-haired, the hair and the curl, since ruler of the synagogue (Acts 18:8) was turned down as an office others held; Stephanas is crowned; Fortunatus is fortunate, the gift and the sparkles, kept apart from blessed, which is the gift and the smile; Achaicus is an Achaian, the map of Achaia with a person. Pentecost is the fiftieth day, five, zero and the sun of a day.");
  ("ACTS IS DRAWN THE SAME WAY. The winds and directions copy the Hebrew compass: the south is the compass and down, the south-west adds the sunset, and the north-west is the compass, up and the sunset. Where a new picture was needed, with what was turned down: the Magi and magic are the magic wand, since the crystal ball is kept for the slave girl who told fortunes (Acts 16:16); evening is the sunset and a star, kept apart from late, which is the bare sunset; a cohort is the helmet and the curly loop of a coil of men; a bay is the hug of the x-ray, since the bosom and the bay are one word; the goddess is the idol with the woman's sign; a viper is the snake and the skull, since the snake and the tooth is already the asp; to delay is the turtle and the pause, since the bare pause is already rest; to pierce is down, the knife and the heart, since the needle is already mending; to defend is the shield and the fist, since the shield alone as doing is already to resist; to adjourn is up, the throw and the pause, since up and the throw is already to exceed; brightness is the flashlight and the sparkles, since the sparkles as a thing are already holiness; purification is the soap and the drop, since the soap and the sparkle is already purity; a dwelling is down, the house and the pin of a place, since down and the house as a thing is already a habitation; to make disciples is the learner with a person, since the learner as doing is already to learn; to do good as a benefactor is the thumbs up, the tools and a person, since the thumbs up and the tools as doing is already to do good; a breaking is the bread broken as a manner, since bread broken as a thing is already a fragment; the queen is the queen; the Areopagus is the hill of the scales of judgment; the cargo is the package on the ship; the dysentery is the microbe and the water, and the pestilence is the microbe and the skull. Every other new word is its root with the prefix and the ending signs, as before.");
  ("THE NAMES OF ACTS. Saul, Ananias, Gamaliel, Haran, Canaan, Shechem, Midian, Molech, Rephan, Gaza, Azotus, Galilee, Lydda, Sharon, Joppa, Tyre, Sidon, Agabus, Kish, Matthew, Thomas, Alphaeus, Bartholomew and Bar-Jesus copy their Hebrew pictures under their Hebrew roots, and the Medes, Elamites and Chaldeans add the person to theirs. Matthias shares Matthew's gift of the LORD and takes the lots he was chosen by (Acts 1:26), so the two men stay apart; Annas shares Hananiah and takes the priest. Rephan is Kiyyun as Stephen quotes Amos (Acts 7:43, Amos 5:26). Tabitha is the female gazelle, and Dorcas, the same word in Greek (Acts 9:36), is the gazelle with the olive of Greek, kept apart because a different root must not share a picture. A name with a meaning is drawn by its meaning, and a name without one by what Acts says of the person or place, with what was turned down: Theophilus is friend of God; Andrew is manly, the man and the strong arm, since the bare man is already the Hebrew man; Philip is fond of horses; Akeldama is the field of blood; Barsabbas is son of pleasing, the son and the smile; Mesopotamia is between two rivers, the map, two and the water; Pamphylia is every tribe; Libya is the land of the south-west wind; Cyrene is the city of the cross, since Simon of Cyrene carried it (Luke 23:26), the map being already Syria's; Caiaphas is the dell with the priest, since the bare valley is already Gehenna; Cyprus is the island of copper, the metal named after it; Sapphira is the sapphire; Theudas, who claimed to be somebody and was killed (Acts 5:36), is the peacock and the skull; Stephen is the crown; Prochorus is before the dance; Nicanor and Nicolaus are victory over a man and over the people; Timon is valuable; Parmenas is constant, beside and the pin of staying; a freedman is the slave with the broken chain; the Ethiopian is the burnt face; Candace is the queen; Caesarea is Caesar's city; Tarsus is a flat basket; Aeneas is the eight years he lay in bed (Acts 9:33); Cornelius is the centurion; Phoenicia is palm country and Phoenix the palm with the anchor of its harbour; Claudius is lame, the crown and the crutch; Rhoda and Rhodes are the rose, drawn as the bouquet since the rose is not in the picture set; Blastus is a sprout; Niger is black; Manaen is the comforter, Menahem; Seleucia is the king's city; Salamis and Salmone are the surge on the shore; Paphos is where Elymas was struck blind (Acts 13:11), the white cane, and Elymas the magician in the dark; Sergius the proconsul copies the proconsul; Perga is a tower; Lycaonia and Lycia are the wolf; Derbe is the juniper, the tree; Zeus is the idol with lightning, and the Twin Brothers are his two sons; Attalia is a king's harbour; Silas is Silvanus; Mysia is the land Paul passed by (Acts 16:8), the footprints; Samos is a height in the sea; Lydia and Thyatira are purple, the dye she sold (Acts 16:14); the spirit of divination is the python with the crystal ball; Amphipolis is the city a river goes around; Apollonia is the sun's city; Berea is the city of the open book, since they searched the scriptures daily (Acts 17:11); the Epicureans are pleasure's teachers and the Stoics the teachers of the porch; Dionysius is a reveller; Damaris is tamed, gentle; Priscilla is little Prisca; Gallio is the rooster his Latin name says; Tyrannus is the tyrant; Sceva is left-handed; Artemis is the goddess with the bow; the Asiarch is the crown of Asia; Secundus is second; Eutychus is fortunate, the good lot, kept apart from Fortunatus's gift and sparkles; Assos is where Paul walked to (Acts 20:13); Mitylene is shellfish, the crab; Chios is the snow its name sounds like; Patara is where they changed ships (Acts 21:1-2); Ptolemais is warlike; Mnason is the early disciple who hosted Paul (Acts 21:16); Felix is happy; Lysias is the commander who set Paul free from the mob (Acts 23:27); Antipatris is in place of a father; Tertullus is the orator; Drusilla is a Herod woman, the superhero Herod wears; Bernice is victorious; Porcius is the pig his Latin name says; Festus is festal; Agrippa is the tamer of wild horses; imperial is the crown that is bowed to; Myra is myrrh, the incense; Cnidus is the headland of contrary winds (Acts 27:7); Lasea is the harbour town; the northeaster is the east wind and the wave; Cauda is the island that sheltered the ship (Acts 27:16); the Syrtis is the sand under the waves; the Adriatic is the sea and the compass; Malta is honey, the meaning of its name; Publius is the chief of the people; Syracuse is the city of the spring; Rhegium is a breach; Puteoli is little wells; the Forum is the market hall; Appius is the road; the Taverns are wooden huts. By no means is the gesture of no as a manner word; unknown is not known.");
  ("THE NAMES OF ROMANS. Rebecca, Baal, Jesse and Mary copy their Hebrew pictures under their Hebrew roots. A name with a meaning is drawn by its meaning, and a name without one by what Romans says of the person, with what was turned down: Phoebe is bright, the light with the woman's sign; Epaenetus is praised; Andronicus is the man of victory, the man and the trophy; Aristobulus is best counsel, first place and the lightbulb; Asyncritus is beyond compare, without the together of the scales; Phlegon is blazing, the tongue of fire; Philologus is fond of words, the friend's heart and speech; Patrobas is a father's life, the father and the sprout; Jason is about to cure, the bandage; Sopater and Sosipater, one man by two spellings, are a safe father, rescue and the father; Tryphaena is luxurious and Tryphosa luxuriating, the lotion of luxury as a describing word and as a doing word; Urbanus is of the city; Ampliatus is enlarged, more; Stachys is an ear of grain, the sheaf as a thing, since the sheaf alone is already Demetrius; Rufus is red; Tertius is third and Quartus fourth, the numbers, since third place is already the word third; Lucius is lamplight, the candle, since the light is already Phoebe; Narcissus is the white flower; Nereus is the old man of the sea, the wave and the old man, since the wave alone is already Pontus; Olympas is of Olympus, the mountain; Hermes is the messenger, the wing and speech, and Hermas is named from him; Herod is a hero, the superhero, and Herodion is of Herod, drawn here first so his name can be named from it. Cenchreae is millet, the grain, and a harbour, the anchor. Spain is the west, the map and the sunset; Persis is a Persian woman, the map and the east with a person; Illyricum is the shore of the Adriatic, the map and the wave. Junia's name has no meaning given, so Junia is the fellow prisoner Romans 16:7 calls them, the chains and the pin of together; the month of June was turned down as a calendar the pictures do not have. Julia and Julius share a family name read as downy, youthful, so they are the child; the month of July was turned down because seven with a name would read as Septimus, and the household of Caesar as a guess. Apelles is approved in Christ (Romans 16:10), the microscope that testing already wears.");
  ("MARK IS DRAWN THE SAME WAY. Its Aramaic words copy the Hebrew word they say: talitha is the little lamb, koum is arise with the call sign, because arise alone is already raise (egeiro) in the New Testament, Ephphatha is the unlocked lock with the call sign, Eloi is my God, lama is why with the call sign, because why alone is already who (tis), sabachthani is you have left me, Corban is the offering brought near, and Hosanna is save with pleading. Where a new picture was needed, with what was turned down: the small is the baby, so the little daughter, the little fish and the young lamb all add the baby; the pinching hand was turned down for those because it is already the girl (korasion) and the fish (opsarion). The roof (stege) is the house with the umbrella, because the house and the top is already the housetop (doma). To catch (agreuo) is the fishing pole with speech, as they set out to catch him in his words (Mark 12:13); the snare is already the stumbling block and the fishing pole alone is already to entice. Leprosy is the bandage, the person and the thing, because the bandage and the thing is already healing; to hurt is the bandage and the blow, because the bandage alone with the doing sign is already to heal. To kneel is kneeling and the fall; kneeling with the doing sign is already to serve. To grind the teeth is the tooth repeated, because the tooth is already to bite. To shorten (koloboo) is the scissors and the clock, as the days are cut short (Mark 13:20). The legion is the helmet, all and the crowd, because the helmet and the crowd is already the army. Green is the herb, because the leaf is already light (elaphros). Rocky ground is the rock and the field. To trouble (skullo) is the weary face repeated, because the weary face alone is already to torment. To convulse is the shaking face and the blow, because the shaking face alone is already to trouble (tarasso). To anoint (murizo) is the ointment and the hand.");
  ("THE NAMES OF MARK. Abiathar, Arimathea, Beelzebul, Gennesaret, the Gerasenes, Golgotha, Zebedee, Jairus, Idumea, Joses, Levi, Magdalene, Salome, the Nazarene and the Syrophoenician copy their Hebrew pictures under their Hebrew roots. A Greek-only name is drawn by its meaning, with what was turned down: Barabbas is son of the father; Bartimaeus is son of Timaeus, and Timaeus is honoured, the reading turned down being Strong's unclean; Boanerges is sons of thunder, as Mark explains it (Mark 3:17); Bethany is house of dates, Bethsaida house of fishing, Bethphage house of figs; Gethsemane is the oil press; Dalmanutha has no sure meaning and is the land by the boat where Jesus came to it (Mark 8:10); the Decapolis is ten cities; Capernaum is village of comfort; Thaddaeus is great-hearted, the reading tied to his other name Lebbaeus, from the Hebrew for heart; Iscariot is man of Kerioth, the man and the city; the Herodians and Herodias wear Herod's hero.");
  ("LUKE IS DRAWN THE SAME WAY. Where a new picture was needed, with what was turned down: the arm (ankale) is the hug and the arm, because the arm alone is already strength (ischus) and the hug with the thing is already the helper (parakletos). To leap in the womb is the pregnant woman and the cartwheel, because the cartwheel with the doing sign is already to leap (hallomai). To vanish is the fading face, because no eyes is already unseen. To dig deep is the hole going down, because the wave going down is already to sink (buthizo). Rest (anapausis) is up and the pause, because the pause with the thing is already rest (katapausis); the plow is the ox and the earth, because the ox, the earth and the doing sign is already to plow. Laughter is the laughing face repeated, because the laughing face with the doing sign is already to play. Born (gennetos) is the hatching chick and the person, because the chick with the describing sign is already cowardly. The account (diegesis) is through and speech, because the open book and speech is already the reading. Within is in at a place, because in with the manner sign is already from within. To gather (athroizo) is the crowd and the magnet, because up and the crowd is already to gather together. To dawn (epiphosko) is up and the dawn, because the dawn alone with the doing sign is already to shine. Mint is the herb, the nose and the smile, because the herb and the nose is already the spice. Healing (therapeia) is the bandage and the kneeling servant, because it is also the household that serves (Luke 12:42) and the bandage with the thing is already healing (iasis). Hardly (mogis) is the tired face, because the persevering and the weary face are already hardly (molis) and hard (duskolos). To surround is around, because the turning arrows around are already the turning (trope). To terrify is the fearful face and the lightning, because the fearful face with the doing sign is already to tremble. The ruin of the house (rhegma) is the house and the crash, because the broken chain with the thing is already freedom. To pretend is the theatre and the person, because the theatre with the doing sign is already the theatre. The wound (trauma) is the bandaged face, because the bandage is already to heal; the inner room is the house, the package and the lock, because the house and the lock is already the house shut; to be broken to pieces (sunthlao) is together, the stone and the crash (Luke 20:18), because together and the crash is already to crush. The spy is in and the telescope, because down and the telescope is already the watchman; fine linen is the thread and the soap, as in the Old Testament; the turtledove is the dove and the voice of its cooing; the sparrow copies the bird of the Old Testament; the well and the valley copy theirs; the debtor is the borrowed tool and the bill. Unprofitable (achreios) is filed with useless (achrestos), to accuse (diaballo) with the accuser (diabolos), many times more with many (polus), and disgrace (oneidos) with reproach (oneidismos), each pair being one word family.");
  ("THE NAMES OF LUKE. Most are the genealogy, and they copy their Hebrew pictures under their Hebrew roots: Abilene the meadow, Addi the ornament, Emmaus the warm spring, Janna oppressing, Cosam divination, Nain the pasture, Bethlehem the house of bread, Joanna, Joanan and Jonam the LORD's gift, Melchi the king, Zacchaeus the pure, and the rest as the Old Testament table draws them. The Ninevite and the Syrian take the person sign on their places. A name Strong's gives only in Greek or Latin is drawn by its meaning: Augustus is the crown bowed to, the reverend one; Cleopas is renowned father, the name called out and the father; Lysanias is ending sorrow, the free sign and the crying face; Martha is mistress, the woman and the crown; Tiberius is named for the river Tiber, the water and the crown; Trachonitis is the rough district, the rock and the crash on the map. Thirteen names wait, each for a reason already written in the Old Testament table: Arphaxad is foreign; Terah, Lamech, Melea, Chorazin and Chuza are uncertain; Elmodam is only perhaps; Jorim is perhaps Joram, who is not drawn yet; Maath and Mainan are probably Hebrew with no word named; Quirinius is Latin with no meaning given; Shem and Nathan wait under the phrase rule; and Judas waits by the human's choice.");
  ("MATTHEW IS DRAWN THE SAME WAY. Where a new picture was needed, with what was turned down: to explain (diasapheo) is through, the light and speech, because through, the lightbulb and the doing sign is already to know thoroughly. To belch out a saying (ereugomai) is the exhaling face and speech, because that face with the doing sign is already to be weary. To hire is the banknote, the person and the doing sign, because the banknote with the doing sign is already to spend. To grow cold is the cold face, the describing sign and the doing sign, because the cold face with the doing sign is already to shudder. To wash off (aponipto, Matthew 27:24) is away, the bath and the hand, because away, the bath and the doing sign is already to wash away. Still (akmen) is the hourglass running on, because the hourglass with the manner sign is already long ago. To drown is down into the sea and the person, because down, the sea and the doing sign is already the flood. To search out (exetazo) is out, the magnifying glass and the question, because out, the glass and the doing sign is already to search. The friend (hetairos) is the handshake and the smile, because the handshake and the person is already the partner. To prompt (probibazo) is before, the fist and the crash, because before, the fist and the doing sign is already to excel. Magdala is the tower at a place, because the tower with the name sign is already Perga. Myrrh is the tree and its drop of resin, because the herb and the lotion bottle is already nard. Dill is the herb and the umbrella of its flower head, because the herb and the leaf is already rue. Cummin is the herb, the seed and the salt of seasoning, because the herb and the seed is already mustard. The rest follow their roots: the hook and to hang oneself are the bent arm's root (ankale), the hook and the knot; the casting net is the net thrown and the dragnet the net drawn wide; the furnace, the huge fish and the gnat are the furnace, the whale and the mosquito; the stater is the coin of four drachmas; the mile is the road measured; the iota, the smallest letter, is the writing hand and the small sign; Gadara, which Strong's gives no meaning, is drawn by what the Bible says happened there, the pigs and the tombs (Matthew 8:28-32); Eli is my God, copying Eloi (Mark 15:34); Rahab copies Hebrews; Raca copies the Hebrew empty.");
  ("THE NAMES OF MATTHEW. The genealogy (Matthew 1:1-16) copies its Hebrew pictures under their Hebrew roots, each drawn first in the Old Testament table: Abiud, Azor, Ahaz, Achim, Eliud, Jeconiah, Jotham, Joram, Josiah, Manasseh, Matthan, Uzziah, Uriah, Rehoboam, Salmon, Tamar, Zerah, Rachel and Rahab. Bar-Jonah is son and Jonah's dove. Archelaus is people-ruling, the crown over the family and the ruler. The Canaanite woman is Canaan with the describing sign. Four names wait: Asa, because Strong's calls its origin uncertain; Ruth, because Strong's gives its meaning only as probably friend; Chorazin, as in Luke; and Judas by the human's choice.");
  ("JOHN IS DRAWN THE SAME WAY. Where a new picture was needed, with what was turned down: to go fishing is the fishing pole and the fish, since the pole as doing already means to entice; aloes are the herb, the drop and the lotion bottle, a fragrant gum; a charcoal fire is the fire and rock of coal with the place sign; the master of the feast is the beginning sign of a ruler over the fork and knife; a palm branch is the palm tree and the leaf; to eat is the fork and knife and the mouth, since the fork and knife alone is food; birth is the hatching chick as a thing; a money box is the money bag locked; tenth is filed with the tithe, ten as a describing word, because both words say tenth; to pierce (ekkenteo) is out and the scorpion's sting, the word's own root, and to pierce (nusso) is the spear as doing, the spear that pierced his side (John 19:34); in the very act is upon, the self-pointing arrow and the ninja of theft; to smear on is over, the oil and the hand, since over and oil with doing already means to pour on; a nail is the hammer and the pin, there being no nail; a sheath is the sword's house; livestock is the ox, the bread and the giving hands, beasts that are raised; to prune is the soap and the scissors, a cleansing cut; graveclothes are the coffin and the ribbon of binding; a coin is the scissors and the coin, a clipping, and the money changer is its doer; a vine branch is the vine and the leaf, since the broken bread of the word's root would read as the Supper; better is the sick face with the rising chart; a towel is the sponge and the hand as a thing, what wipes; the Pavement is stone strewn as a bed; a pound is the scales and one; a basin is the foot and the bath, the basin of the feet (John 13:5), since the bath as a thing already means washing; to stink is the sick face and the nose; a little boy is the child made small; father-in-law is the Hebrew picture for father-in-law; which of two is two and the question; the heel is the foot and the back, since Jacob's hand and foot is a name; to flow is the wave going on; a title is the placard and the writing hand, since the bare placard is already a sign; woven is the thread knotted; a lantern is the lamp and the light; the winter stream is winter's snow and clock with the wave. In Hebrew and in Latin take the describing manner of the Hebrew and of Rome with speech; the Samaritan woman is the Samaritan with the woman's sign.");
  ("THE NAMES OF JOHN. Aenon is place of springs, from the Hebrew eye, which also means a spring as the eye of the land, so it is the eye and the fountain. Ephraim copies its Hebrew picture with the name sign and two, the double fruit its name says, because the bare fruit with the name sign is already Carpus. Cana and Malchus copy Kanah, reediness, and Melech, king, drawn first in the Old Testament table; Kidron, dusky place, copies the Hebrew picture of mourning dark, drawn there first with its verb. Sychar is Shekar, strong drink, as Strong's reads it. Didymus means twin, so it wears the twin picture Thomas already wears, the two babies, because John gives both names to one man (John 11:16). Gabbatha is the knoll, a small mountain, drawn by meaning since Strong's only compares it to the Aramaic. Nicodemus is victory among the people, the trophy and the crowd. Tiberias is the town named for Tiberius, his picture with the place sign. Three names wait: Clopas, because the Hebrew name it answers to, Ahab, still waits for a brother picture; Salim, because Strong's calls its root probably; and Judas by the human's choice.");
  ("REVELATION IS DRAWN THE SAME WAY. Alpha and Omega are the first and the last letter, so the first place and the end arrow, each with the writing hand; the letters themselves were turned down because no picture is a Greek letter. THE GEMS are the gem with what tells them apart: jasper the sparkles, from its Hebrew root to polish; sapphire the blue circle; jacinth the purple circle, hyacinth's colour, since blue is sapphire; sardius the red circle and sardonyx the red and the white for its bands, both filed under Sardis, the city they are named for; emerald the leaf for green, since no green circle is drawn; beryl the sea for its sea green; chalcedony the bronze, from Strong's copper-like; amethyst the gem with not and drunk, which is what its name says; chrysolite gold and stone, chrysoprase gold and the herb for its leek green; and topaz waits, because Strong's says it is probably the chrysolite. Crystal is ice and rock, Strong's ice and rock crystal; glass is the window and the stone, since the magnifying glass already means to search; the rainbow is the bow and the cloud, the bow God set in the cloud, and so the archer's bow is the bow and the arrow, since the bow alone is sin as missing the mark; hail is ice and rain; lukewarm is cold and hot together, beside hot and cold already drawn. Animals with their own picture are just that picture: bear, frog, leopard; the bird is the hen as a birdling, since the bird and baby is already a young bird; the tail is the back and a curl, no tail being drawn. Without mixture is not with wine and shuffle, because not and shuffle is already harmless, a word of another root; to vomit is vomiting and mouth, since vomiting as doing is to abhor; to behead is the axe and the face, since the axe as doing is to cut off; luxury is the couch and lamp with sparkles, since the couch as doing is to recline; kidneys, the inmost mind, are the heart organ at the back; a carriage is four and the wheel, since the chariot is another word; cinnamon is the wood and the curl, from its Hebrew root, bark in upright rolls.");
  ("THE NAMES OF REVELATION. Abaddon copies its Hebrew picture, destruction, the wilted flower and the place; Apollyon is destroyer, the wilted flower as the doer, with the name sign. Armageddon is the mountain of Megiddo, the mountain with Megiddo's Hebrew picture, crowd and place, from its root to crowd. Balak is waster, zero as the doer; Gad is from the Hebrew root to attack, the boxing glove, which Jacob's blessing of Gad repeats, and Leah's fortune was turned down because Strong's derives the name from the attack; Issachar is he will bring a reward, lifting with the reward's coin and hammer; the Euphrates is rushing, the wave dashing away, from an unused root, which is drawn by what Strong's says it means. Antipas is against and father, both from Strong's. Patmos has no meaning given, so it is drawn by what the Bible says of it, an isle, the sea and the rock; Pergamum is fortified, from the tower, with the city sign since tower and place is already Magdala; Smyrna is myrrh with the place; Philadelphia is brotherly love with the place; Sardis has no meaning given, so it is drawn by what is said to it, a name that it lives and is dead, the name tag and the skull; the Nicolaitans are Nicolaus's people, his picture with the person sign. Four names wait: Gog, because Strong's calls it of uncertain derivation, and Magog with it, being from Gog; Jezebel, because both roots it is built from are undrawn and its meaning is disputed; and Judas by the human's choice.");
  ("THE LAST SEVEN WORDS OF THE GOSPELS ARE DRAWN THE SAME WAY, each under the root Strong's builds it from. Hard to bear is the burden of bearing with the weary face; since indeed shares the picture of since, because it is since made stronger; of a mill is the millstone as a describing word; virginity is the veil of the virgin as a thing; the flow of blood is the flowing water as a thing, because Strong's says the word takes its root in the sense of flowing; exceedingly is the overflowing spring as a manner. To gleam is the light and the sparkle under a key of its own, because Strong's gives it no root; the sparkle alone was turned down because holiness already wears it, and the flashlight because the shining words already wear it. Topaz and the names still wait for the reasons written above.");
  ("EVERY NAME READ AGAINST TWO SOURCES, 2026-10-27, and none redrawn. ",
    fn_name("bible_greek_name_meanings"),
    " gives Strong's own meaning of the Greek word and, for a name from Hebrew, Brown, Driver and Briggs on the Hebrew it points to; of 442 name pictures, 55 reach a BDB meaning and every one of those agrees. Where Strong's says something else the picture keeps a stronger witness, and these are the readings set aside: Barnabas is son and comfort because Acts 4:36 glosses it so, not son of prophecy; Pilate is a spear, the pilum the name is usually taken from, not close-pressed or firm; Tychicus carries a letter and Erastus keeps a city's money, because that is what the letters say they did, not fortunate and beloved; Gad stays a raid as in the Hebrew table, for Genesis 49, not good fortune.");
